      "nameEn": "DSH Mind Workbench",
      "description": {
        "zh": "在 DSH Desktop 里创建、编辑与导出思维导图：完整画布支持节点操作、主题、结构、图标、关联线、概要、外框、标记、待办、公式、演示模式、大纲、小地图、水印与搜索替换，并提供导图文件（.smm，可再次导入）、图片（PNG）、SVG、PDF、Markdown、XMind、Txt、JSON 八种导出格式；文档保存在 DSH 数据目录，并可在会话中让 Agent 直接读写成导图。",
        "en": "Create, edit and export mind maps inside DSH Desktop, with a full canvas (node editing, themes, layouts, icons, relationships, summaries, boundaries, markers, tasks, formulas, presentation mode, outline, minimap, watermark and find-and-replace) and eight export formats (mind-map file .smm, Image PNG, SVG, PDF, Markdown, XMind, Txt, JSON). Documents are stored in the DSH data directory, and the agent can read and write maps from the conversation."
